Z||000000||Fiero5||06-05-2001||03:12 PM||||Well folks, as promised - here they are!<P>A nice long shot of all 10 Fieros!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fieros_in_a_line-June3.jpg"> <P>This shot is taken over Jody Lemos 86GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fieroslined_up1.jpg"> <P>A little further out front to see all the hoods<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fieroslined_up2.jpg"> <P>Can you make out who's who in this pic?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieropeopleAlmost_everyone.jpg"> <P>Starting from left to right:<BR>Fred "Mr. Potatohead" Clark's maroon baby<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1-Fredscoupe.jpg"> <BR>Dave Paulk's "still in process" project<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2-Daves_conversion.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>                        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero9-86SS1.jpg">                        <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||6
Z||000001||Fiero5||06-05-2001||03:13 PM||||Les Sandy's sweet T-Top coupe<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3-Les's_coupe.jpg"> <BR>Rob & Renee' Dabrowski's awesome black 86GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/4-Robs_86.5_GT.jpg"> <BR>Josh Bumpus's shiny 88 coupe<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/5-Josh's_88_coupe.jpg"> <BR>Matt Turner's bright white SE<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/6-Matt's_SE.jpg"> <BR>Phil Randolph's yellow Formula of course<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/7-Phils_88_Formula-Duh!.jpg"> <BR>Marian Kelley's "newly" enveiled 88 Formula fastback<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/8-Marians_88_Formula_fastback.jpg"> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fiero5||06-05-2001||03:19 PM||||Steve Kelley's '86 SS<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/9-Steve's_'86_SS.jpg"> <BR>Jody Lemos's 86GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/10-Jody's_86_GT.jpg"> <P>...and the winners are:<P>Rob & Renee' Dabrowski ties 3rd place<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Rob_D._winning_3rd.jpg"> <BR>with<BR>Les Sandy<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Les_winning_3rd.jpg"> <BR>Matt Turner ties 2nd place<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Matt_winning_2nd.jpg"> <BR>with<BR>Josh Bumpus<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Josh_winning_2nd.jpg"> <P>....and 1st goes to...if anyone get's this wrong<BR>Phil Randolph!!!!!!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Phil_winning_1st.jpg"> <P>More pics coming....<P>Enjoy<P>Steve Kelley||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fiero5||06-05-2001||03:50 PM||||Here is "Mr Potatohead" Fred Clark proudly displaying our best club participation trophy/plaque.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fred_with_club_plaque.jpg"> <P>Close up please...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Close_up_of_plaque_1.jpg"> <P><BR>Here is what the trophies looked like, as Josh modeled his on his 88 from a previous post<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Josh's_trophy.jpg"> ||||reg||12
