Z||000005||Boomtastic||06-05-2001||06:06 PM||||(ahem)  Marian's black "Formula" .. can we talk about that engine??? I think you need one with more 'grunt'! How about a nice 70K one from an '85 GT? I may even deliver this one to ya ...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR> <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=591972285" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=591972285</A> <P>||||reg||5
